+/-- **The marked mirror `(F_s)_w`** of the chamber `F_w`: the cells of `F_w` whose mirror type
+contains the generator `s`. -/
+def MarkedMirror (w : CayGroup A) (s : V) (p : Sph A) : Prop :=
+  InChamber w p ∧ s ∈ p.spx
