+      exact faceMap_stickSimplex_mem_codimTwo _ t ht
+    · exact stickSimplex_cubeFace_zero_mem_codimTwo i hi t
+  · rw [stickSimplex_cubeFace_one]
+    exact faceMap_stickSimplex_mem_codimTwo _ t ht
+
+end FiniteChains.TopologicalSingular
